  "previous_attempt_root_cause": {
    "version_id": "V2-opening-practice",
    "finding": "The 32-byte generic postlude beginning at 0x00E0 overwrote the V1 non-target fallback beginning at 0x00F7. The name-screen text path had bank 0x0C and took that fallback, consistent with the observed invalid control flow.",
